     "op": "theory",
     "blockId": "p53-definition",
     "replacement": "A **combination** is an **unordered** selection of $r$ distinct objects from a set of $n$ distinct objects, with no object chosen more than once.\n\nFor integers $n$ and $r$ with $0\\le r\\le n$, the number of combinations is:\n\n$${}^{n}C_r=\\frac{n!}{r!(n-r)!}$$",
     "autoApply": true,
     "key": "theory|p53-definition",
     "targetFingerprint": "fef6f5c3e66f8a4a910cad8f7e9fef9efeed9f5017121605aa9e2f1c00f9c87c",
