     "op": "theory",
     "blockId": "p66-identities-block",
     "replacement": "${}^nC_n={}^nC_0=1$ for $n\\ge0$\n\n${}^nC_1={}^nC_{n-1}=n$ for $n\\ge1$\n\n${}^nC_r={}^nC_{n-r}$ for $0\\le r\\le n$\n\n${}^nC_r={}^{n-1}C_{r-1}+{}^{n-1}C_r$ for $1\\le r\\le n-1$ (**Pascal's identity**)\n\n${}^nC_0+{}^nC_1+{}^nC_2+\\cdots+{}^nC_n=2^n$ for $n\\ge0$",
     "autoApply": true,
